{"markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"","page-layout":"full","toc":false},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->\n<section class=\"hero-section\">\n  <div class=\"hero-inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"hero-text\">\n      <div class=\"hero-name\">Shuai Ma</div>\n      <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">Urban Planning Researcher <br>\n        Housing Markets, Public Investment, and Urban Informatics</p>\n\n      <p class=\"hero-description\">\n        I study how place-based public investments reshape housing and land markets, and how those market responses redistribute wealth, risk, and residential opportunity across communities. Methodologically, my work combines spatial data science, causal inference, and interpretable machine learning to analyze urban and housing-market dynamics.\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"hero-agenda\">\n        <span class=\"agenda-label\">Research Agenda</span>\n        Place-Based Public Investment, Housing Markets, and Spatial Inequality\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"hero-buttons\">\n        <a href=\"research.html\" class=\"btn btn-academic\">Research</a>\n        <a href=\"practice.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-academic\">Practice</a>\n        <a href=\"cv.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-academic\">CV</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-image\">\n      <img src=\"images/image1.png\" alt=\"Shuai Ma\" class=\"profile-photo\" />\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── Research Snapshot ─────────────────────────────────── -->\n<section class=\"snapshot-section\">\n  <div class=\"section-inner\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Research Areas</h2>\n    <div class=\"snapshot-grid\">\n\n      <div class=\"snapshot-card\">\n        <h3>Housing &amp; Land Markets</h3>\n        <p>I examine how public investments, infrastructure, and policy interventions are capitalized into housing prices and land values.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"snapshot-card\">\n        <h3>Public Investment &amp; Climate Adaptation</h3>\n        <p>I study how climate-adaptation investments, especially flood-mitigation projects, affect property values, risk perceptions, and development patterns in vulnerable communities.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"snapshot-card\">\n        <h3>Spatial Inequality &amp; Distributional Effects</h3>\n        <p>I analyze whether the benefits of place-based investments reach the households and neighborhoods that need them most, or whether market responses concentrate gains among already-advantaged groups.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"snapshot-card\">\n        <h3>Urban Informatics &amp; Spatial Data Science</h3>\n        <p>I use GIS, causal inference, spatial data science, and interpretable machine learning to study housing markets, public investment, and neighborhood change.</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── Current Project ───────────────────────────────────── -->\n<section class=\"project-section\">\n  <div class=\"section-inner\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Research Prospectus</h2>\n    <div class=\"project-block\">\n      <h3 class=\"project-title\">\n        Who Benefits from Flood-Mitigation Investment?\n      </h3>\n      <p class=\"project-tagline\">\n        Housing Capitalization, Spatial Spillovers, and Distributional Effects\n        in Flood-Prone Communities\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"project-description\">\n        This project examines whether flood-mitigation investments are capitalized\n        into nearby housing values, how far their effects extend across space, and\n        how benefits and costs are distributed across neighborhoods with different\n        income levels, tenure structures, and social vulnerability.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->\n<section class=\"hero-section\">\n  <div class=\"hero-inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"hero-text\">\n      <div class=\"hero-name\">Shuai Ma</div>\n      <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">Urban Planning Researcher <br>\n        Housing Markets, Public Investment, and Urban Informatics</p>\n\n      <p class=\"hero-description\">\n        I study how place-based public investments reshape housing and land markets, and how those market responses redistribute wealth, risk, and residential opportunity across communities. Methodologically, my work combines spatial data science, causal inference, and interpretable machine learning to analyze urban and housing-market dynamics.\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"hero-agenda\">\n        <span class=\"agenda-label\">Research Agenda</span>\n        Place-Based Public Investment, Housing Markets, and Spatial Inequality\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"hero-buttons\">\n        <a href=\"research.html\" class=\"btn btn-academic\">Research</a>\n        <a href=\"practice.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-academic\">Practice</a>\n        <a href=\"cv.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-academic\">CV</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-image\">\n      <img src=\"images/image1.png\" alt=\"Shuai Ma\" class=\"profile-photo\" />\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── Research Snapshot ─────────────────────────────────── -->\n<section class=\"snapshot-section\">\n  <div class=\"section-inner\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Research Areas</h2>\n    <div class=\"snapshot-grid\">\n\n      <div class=\"snapshot-card\">\n        <h3>Housing &amp; Land Markets</h3>\n        <p>I examine how public investments, infrastructure, and policy interventions are capitalized into housing prices and land values.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"snapshot-card\">\n        <h3>Public Investment &amp; Climate Adaptation</h3>\n        <p>I study how climate-adaptation investments, especially flood-mitigation projects, affect property values, risk perceptions, and development patterns in vulnerable communities.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"snapshot-card\">\n        <h3>Spatial Inequality &amp; Distributional Effects</h3>\n        <p>I analyze whether the benefits of place-based investments reach the households and neighborhoods that need them most, or whether market responses concentrate gains among already-advantaged groups.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"snapshot-card\">\n        <h3>Urban Informatics &amp; Spatial Data Science</h3>\n        <p>I use GIS, causal inference, spatial data science, and interpretable machine learning to study housing markets, public investment, and neighborhood change.</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── Current Project ───────────────────────────────────── -->\n<section class=\"project-section\">\n  <div class=\"section-inner\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Research Prospectus</h2>\n    <div class=\"project-block\">\n      <h3 class=\"project-title\">\n        Who Benefits from Flood-Mitigation Investment?\n      </h3>\n      <p class=\"project-tagline\">\n        Housing Capitalization, Spatial Spillovers, and Distributional Effects\n        in Flood-Prone Communities\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"project-description\">\n        This project examines whether flood-mitigation investments are capitalized\n        into nearby housing values, how far their effects extend across space, and\n        how benefits and costs are distributed across neighborhoods with different\n        income levels, tenure structures, and social vulnerability.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,